       project blends in LINEAR light, so the alpha is chosen against the WORST pixel any picture can have, pure white: at 0.94
       the ground stays at luminance 0.062 and the eyebrow (--ts-on-scrim-2) keeps 7.7:1, the title 9.3:1, over any picture
